{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026u4HVpryF8m1793615401.jpeg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產北角城市分行高級資深區域營業董事林龍南表示，中原新近促成天后電氣道DIVA買賣成交，單位為低層A室，實用面積721平方呎，採3房1套連儲物室間隔，向西，望內街。單位原先開價1,280萬元放售，業主因應市況調整叫價，最終減價72萬元，以1,208萬元成交，折合實用呎價16,755元。</p><p> </p><p>林龍南表示，新買家為用家，心儀物業鄰近港鐵天后站及維多利亞公園，生活與交通極為便利，遂決定購入自用。據了解，原業主於2014年以1,294萬元購入單位，持貨12年，是次沽出賬面蝕86萬元或約6.6%。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T11:20:55.277263+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":246,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T08:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T07:58:38.663768+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T11:18:17.429532+00:00","content_hash":"f85cd045963fdf8cbca8ea6e10b8c9bd446197550ed583a7584015ca028da9b6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T11:20:55.277263+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}